{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《玫瑰戰爭》最新劇情迎來高潮，劇中傅嘉莉驚覺丈夫陳展鵬與陳楨怡發生婚外情，雙方隨即爆發激烈衝突。面對妻子的連番 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《玫瑰戰爭》最新劇情迎來高潮，劇中傅嘉莉驚覺丈夫陳展鵬與陳楨怡發生婚外情，雙方隨即爆發激烈衝突。面對妻子的連番質問，男方不但沒有退縮，反而將矛頭直指她與另一男星之間存在不可告人秘密。隨後女方更被直擊崩潰痛哭倒在對方懷中，讓這段豪門婚姻背後隱藏巨大謎團。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉《玫瑰戰爭》捉姦爆發激烈爭執</h2>\n<p>根據《玫瑰戰爭》第5集預告畫面，由傅嘉莉飾演梁菲雅終於發現殘酷真相，得知丈夫與陳楨怡在外面偷偷出軌。兩夫妻在室內隨即上演一場火藥味十足大鬥法，雙方情緒徹底失控並互相咆哮。這場對質戲碼展現出極強張力，劇情直接將夫妻之間信任危機推向最高點。</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬反擊大爆妻子與馬國明非比尋常</h2>\n<p>在這場激烈對峙之中，面對妻子聲嘶力竭連番指控，陳展鵬飾演丈夫竟然毫不示弱，更冷笑反唇相譏：「你結咗婚之後，你冇同其他男人過夜？」傅嘉莉起初神情堅定並斬釘截鐵否認指控，豈料男方隨即拋出一句「咁德龍呢」，直接點名道姓質疑她與馬國明飾演李德龍關係極度曖昧。</p>\n<h2>梁菲雅伏在李德龍懷中痛哭畫面終流出</h2>\n<p>原本看似理直氣壯，卻因為這句反問陷入被動局面。緊接著預告畫面出現驚人反轉，鏡頭一轉赫然見到傅嘉莉整個人崩潰倒在馬國明懷裡痛哭流涕。兩人不但雙手緊緊交握，女方更主動俯身壓向男方，預告畫面最後更定格在兩人超越普通朋友親密互動之上。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》第五集完整預告：</h2>\n<p>《玫瑰》試戲場上，無雙、綺雲演技火花四濺，雲生拍板由綺雲擔任女主角……菲雅遭永康訓斥沒好好維繫與家俊的夫妻關係，菲雅敢怒不敢言。無雙使計刺激菲雅的演戲欲，令她考慮接拍《玫瑰》。寶兒向德龍透露自己獲邀請加入天誠，心情忐忑，德龍向她訴說「朋友」的經歷。德龍本獲安排參演《玫瑰》，卻被雲生抽起。家俊因為菲雅故意在素希面前宣示主權，與菲雅大吵一場。酒醉的菲雅往找德龍；另邊廂，素希偷拍與家俊的親密照。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577189194435_14903452346af586fc5df33.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11123.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577189194435_14903452346af586fc5df33.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>與丈夫大吵一場後，傅嘉莉酒醉往找馬國明，更伏在對方懷中痛哭。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577932719916_9620192596af58703af3fb.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11121.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447577932719916_9620192596af58703af3fb.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>最後突然爆喊！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447575639441824_19737929616af586ecbff6d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447575639441824_19737929616af586ecbff6d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳展鵬同陳楨怡非常曖昧！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447576309213702_16869704296af586f38444c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11124.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447576309213702_16869704296af586f38444c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳楨怡為了幫忙復仇，按照計劃勾引陳展鵬（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447578757710357_10977425536af5870be084a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447578757710357_10977425536af5870be084a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>傅嘉莉劇中揭發丈夫陳展鵬出軌，夫妻當面對質，場面火藥味十足！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794475793884253_7655386836af5871263afa.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-10\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794475793884253_7655386836af5871263afa.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳展鵬即刻質問「你結咗婚之後，你冇同其他男人過夜？」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944758010941202_20766756946af58719720f2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944758010941202_20766756946af58719720f2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>無雙使計刺激菲雅的演戲欲，令她考慮接拍《玫瑰》。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447580760696126_12405424846af5872027d9c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-8\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447580760696126_12405424846af5872027d9c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>菲雅成功做到女主角（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447581663963263_12598346246af587291ce29.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-7\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447581663963263_12598346246af587291ce29.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%82%85%e5%98%89%e8%8e%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">傅嘉莉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%b1%95%e9%b5%ac/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳展鵬</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541359\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T16:03:55.543106+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1377,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:45:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:28.554965+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T15:57:28.554965+00:00","content_hash":"39784717c5ac3b83816d9f1792c0a1af2d29295f8f6870488d3266b464e993ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}